WEBVTT

00:04:28.222 --> 00:04:30.016
Once safety can be established,

00:04:30.016 --> 00:04:32.059
support is the next essential feature.

00:04:32.101 --> 00:04:34.353
We think about support very intentionally.

00:04:34.395 --> 00:04:35.563
For queer Africans,

00:04:35.563 --> 00:04:39.483
financial stability plays a huge role
in determining how open we can be.

00:04:39.525 --> 00:04:42.111
And over the years, I've met
queer Africans who believe

00:04:42.153 --> 00:04:44.238
that the only way
they can get ahead at work

00:04:44.238 --> 00:04:45.906
is by abandoning their identities

00:04:45.906 --> 00:04:47.783
and anyone who shares those identities.

00:04:47.825 --> 00:04:49.285
That's a terrible feeling.

00:04:49.285 --> 00:04:52.079
And of course, anyone
suspected of being queer

00:04:52.121 --> 00:04:54.040
might not be able to work at all.

00:04:54.081 --> 00:04:56.000
So in order to counteract this,

00:04:56.042 --> 00:04:59.837
it's important to design a space
with an active opportunities hub

00:04:59.879 --> 00:05:01.130
and marketplace,